<title>USA: Freddie Mac increases REMIC series 1930,1932.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac increases REMIC series 1930,1932.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac or FHLMC) said Tuesday it increased two Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC series 1930 was increased by $200 million of 30-year 7.5 percent single-family fixed-rate mortgages and $225 million of callable passthrough C033, for a total new size of $625 million. The issue has a settlement date on February 28 and was originally priced on January 13, the agency said.</p>
<p>REMIC series 1932 was increased to $450 million from $350 million, Freddie Mac said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
